{title: Praise Him! Praise Him!}
{artist: Fanny J. Crosby}
{genre: Gospel, Hymn}
{style: Hymn}
{flow: Opening}
{key: G}
{tempo: 100}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [C]Jesus, our blessed Re[G]deemer
[G]Sing, O earth, His [D]wonderful love pro[G]claim
[G]Hail Him, hail Him, [C]highest archangels in [G]glory
[G]Strength and honor [D]give to His holy [G]name
[C]Like a shepherd, [G]Jesus will guard His children
[G]In His arms He [D]carries them all day long
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [C]tell of His excellent [G]greatness
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [D]ever in joyful [G]song
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [C]Jesus, our blessed Re[G]deemer
[G]For our sins He [D]suffered and bled and [G]died
[G]He our rock, our [C]hope of eternal sal[G]vation
[G]Hail Him, hail Him, [D]Jesus the cruci[G]fied
[C]Sound His praises, [G]Jesus who bore our sorrows
[G]Love unbounded, [D]wonderful, deep and strong
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [C]tell of His excellent [G]greatness
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [D]ever in joyful [G]song
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [C]Jesus, our blessed Re[G]deemer
[G]Heavenly portals [D]loud with hosannas [G]ring
[G]Jesus, Saviour, [C]reigneth for ever and [G]ever
[G]Crown Him, crown Him, [D]Prophet and Priest and [G]King
[C]Christ is coming, [G]over the world victorious
[G]Power and glory [D]unto the Lord belong
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [C]tell of His excellent [G]greatness
[G]Praise Him, praise Him, [D]ever in joyful [G]song
{end_of_verse}
